rue&quot; class=3D&quot;&quot;&gt;=0A                                                    1. I=
f your printer connects by a wire=0A                                       =
         &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;=
If your printer connects by a wire,=0A                                     =
